#question(title: [Tangent line])[
  Let $f$ be a $C^1$ function at $a in RR$.

  Then the tangent line of $f$ at $a$ is
  given by
  $
    y = L(x)
  $

  + Recall the explicit formula for $L$
  + Prove that $L$ is the 1-st Taylor
    polynomial for $f$ at $a$ using the 1st
    definition.
  + Prove that $L$ is the 1-st Taylor
    polynomial for $f$ at $a$ using the 2nd
    definition.
]
